30
00:01:31,623 --> 00:01:35,392
Isme nadiyan poorab se paschim ki taraf ginayi gayi hain.

31
00:01:35,392 --> 00:01:38,407
Pehle Ganga, phir Yamuna, phir Saraswati, phir Shutudri,

32
00:01:38,407 --> 00:01:41,422
