iska koi lekhit srot nahi,

201
00:10:07,044 --> 00:10:09,670
par bahut logon ki gehri aastha hai.

202
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:13,793
Dhyaan dijiye, yeh lok kahani Mahabharata ki baat se judti hai.

203
00:10:13,793 --> 00:10:17,541
Granth kehta hai, Saraswati Vinasana mein zameen ke andar gayi.

204
00:10:17,541 --> 00:10:21,664
Lok parampara kehti hai, andar hi andar behkar woh Prayagraj pahunchi.

205
00:10:21,664 --> 00:10:25,412
Is baat ka koi vaigyanik sabut abhi hamare paas nahi.

206
00:10:25,412 --> 00:10:29,160
Par sangam par khade hokar, log use mehsoos karte hain.

207
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:31,368
Toh poori kahani ko saath rakhiye.

208
00:10:31,368 --> 00:10:33,945
Granth mahaan nadi ki baat karte hain.

209
00:10:33,945 --> 00:10:37,993
Satellite aur drilling dabi purani nadi dikhate hain. Research kehti hai,

210
00:10:37,993 --> 00:10:40,937
badi Sutlej shehron se pehle hat chuki thi.

211
00:10:40,937 --> 00:10:43,882
Aur vidvaan naam par bante hain. Sabut hain,

212
00:10:43,882 --> 00:10:46,090
par aakhri jawab abhi baaki hai.

213
00:10:46,090 --> 00:10:50,033
Agli baar hum chalenge samundar ki taraf, Gujarat ke tat par.

214
00:10:50,033 --> 00:10:53,976
Wahan paani ke neeche ek aur kahani dabi hai, Dwarka ki.

215
00:10:53,976 --> 00:10:56,485
Granth kya kehte hain, gotakhor kya laaye,

216
00:10:56,485 --> 00:11:00,069
aur experts kya maante hain. Sab kuch, sabut ke saath,

217
00:11:00,069 --> 00:11:02,220
aur har baat par uska label.

218
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:03,407
Ab sawaal aapse.

219
00:11:03,407 --> 00:11:07,364
Aapke hisaab se Saraswati ka paani kahan se aata tha,

220
00:11:07,364 --> 00:11:10,924
Himalaya ke glacier se ya monsoon ki baarish se?

221
00:11:10,924 --> 00:11:13,694
Comment mein bas likhiye, glacier ya baarish.

222
00:11:13,694 --> 00:11:17,651
Aur agar aapke gaon ke paas koi sookhi nadi hai,

223
00:11:17,651 --> 00:11:19,233
uska naam bhi batayiye.
